  "description": "12 Capes for Procreate ( Separate Front and Back pieces )\n1 Croquis Stamp\n1 Dress Stamp\n2 Shaded Figure PNGs\nProcreate stamps are digital stamping templates that allow you to quickly and easily add a design to your artwork. They are beneficial for adding quick elements to your artwork. Procreate stamps can be customized with color, opacity, and additional effects.\nWith this brushset, you can create your fashion illustrations or artwork in minutes.\nQuick and easy to create artwork that looks great and stands out from the rest. Just tap once and the outline for your design is ready.\nCheck out sample illustrations in the listing photos for some inspiration.\nYou will receive the following:\n• 1 “.zip” file\nDIGITAL DOWNLOAD, NO PHYSICAL ITEMS WILL BE SHIPPED\nRequirements\n• iPad\n• Apple Pencil\n• Procreate App\nThe brushes in this set only work with the Apple Pencil and iPad on the Procreate App.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>12 Capes for Procreate ( Separate Front and Back pieces )<br>\n1 Croquis Stamp<br>\n1 Dress Stamp<br>\n2 Shaded Figure PNGs</p>\n<p>Procreate stamps are digital stamping templates that allow you to quickly and easily add a design to your artwork. They are beneficial for adding quick elements to your artwork. Procreate stamps can be customized with color, opacity, and additional effects.</p>\n<p>With this brushset, you can create your fashion illustrations or artwork in minutes.<br>\nQuick and easy to create artwork that looks great and stands out from the rest. Just tap once and the outline for your design is ready.<br>\nCheck out sample illustrations in the listing photos for some inspiration.</p>\n<p>You will receive the following:<br>\n• 1 “.zip” file</p>\n<p>DIGITAL DOWNLOAD, NO PHYSICAL ITEMS WILL BE SHIPPED</p>\n<p>Requirements<br>\n• iPad<br>\n• Apple Pencil<br>\n• Procreate App</p>\n<p>The brushes in this set only work with the Apple Pencil and iPad on the Procreate App.</p>",
